# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only
#
# OmniVision OV05C10 sensor driver, built out of tree.
#
# The driver is Intel's, from intel/ipu6-drivers. It has no mainline
# counterpart -- drivers/media/i2c/ carries ov01a10, ov02a10, ov02c10, ov02e10,
# ov08d10 and ov08x40, but not this one -- so this is an ordinary out-of-tree
# module and not an override of anything the kernel ships.
#
# The board's other requirement, a second link frequency on the OVTI05C1 entry
# in ipu-bridge, is a kernel patch in linux-ptl. ipu-bridge is in-tree, so
# rebuilding it here would fork a kernel file and freeze every other sensor's
# entry in it.
obj-m += ov05c10.o
